GROK-GO

This project is an independent Go implementation informed by the public API
behavior and operational concepts of these projects:

- langrenjh-alt/grok2api-haochi (MIT)
- Wei-Shaw/sub2api (LGPL-3.0)
- geist-org/geist-ui (MIT), consulted only as historical design-system reference

No source code from sub2api is included. Vercel Geist documentation is used as
the visual and interaction specification; GROK-GO's UI components are original
local implementations.
